test). In contrast, the density of neurons with a somal
area greater than 2000 mm
2 in the L5 segment was sig-
nificantly higher in the SMS patient (P < 0.05). Overall,
the total neuronal density was significantly lower in the
SMS patient in three segments T11, L3 and L5 
(P < 0.05). Furthermore, the average neuronal density of
neurons with somal areas of 0–500, 500–1000 and
1000–1500 mm
